    - block_anchor: ~
      content: "Avoid diseased leaves.\n### 2. Protect the soil"
      depth: 1
      is_code: false
      properties: []
    - block_anchor: ~
      content: Add a 5–8 cm layer of mulch.
      depth: 0
      is_code: false
      properties: []
    - block_anchor: ~
      content: "Plant a cover crop such as winter rye.\n---\n**Tip:** you can check your soil with:\n```bash\nsoil-test --ph --moisture\n```\nLet me know if you'd like a week-by-week schedule!"
